{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorboration is a puzzle game where the path of one character is the wall of another. Each level consists of different coloured characters needing to maneuver around their paths and push boxes so that each character can get to their goal.   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042850/extras/079bc922034df205108ae459be3e3aa9.poster.avif?t=1767362752\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042850/extras/079bc922034df205108ae459be3e3aa9.webm?t=1767362752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Solve levels that have fun interactions, to levels that seem impossible. Never get stuck on difficult levels, as there is always a path around to go further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042850/extras/b442f46f93604a90331e1ac742298ebd.poster.avif?t=1767362752\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042850/extras/b442f46f93604a90331e1ac742298ebd.webm?t=1767362752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042850/extras/b442f46f93604a90331e1ac742298ebd.mp4?t=1767362752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has 120+ handcrafted levels with each level containing unique interactions. The game has 5 different worlds, each with their added elements. With branching paths, unlock levels to fully explore the worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042850/extras/404305a44e1f3ffc9d5f35ba51a685b1.poster.avif?t=1767362752\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042850/extras/404305a44e1f3ffc9d5f35ba51a685b1.webm?t=1767362752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042850/extras/404305a44e1f3ffc9d5f35ba51a685b1.mp4?t=1767362752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 worlds with total 120+ levels - with a natural difficulty curve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessibility options - including custom colors, togglable effects &amp; more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A level editor implemented with Steam workshop</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4042850?t=1767362752","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042850/7363023e6eae3a293c36c5bd74ea10270589da6b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767362752","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042850/f7ae5d4236dea3b81abf4574883201df1d4ef8c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767362752","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042850/f7ae5d4236dea3b81abf4574883201df1d4ef8c1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767362752","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Famil